SUMMARY:Literary Happy Hour with Cats
DESCRIPTION:Sip wine\, meet cats\, and discuss literature with an award-winning author. \nJoin us for a special evening with our beloved volunteer\, Jill Rosenberg\, celebrating the release of her award-winning short story collection\, Now I’m Photogenic and Other Stories I Tell Myself.  \nThere will be a short reading\, followed by a discussion of creativity and the role cats can play in the process.  \nJill is a Montclair-based fiction writer and creative writing instructor whose work has appeared in numerous literary journals. Her debut collection won the prestigious St. Lawrence Book Award and was published in 2026.  \nYour admission includes:  \n📖 A signed copy of Jill’s book  \n🍷 A glass of wine  \n🐱 Time with our adoptable cats  \nA portion of the proceeds will benefit the Catfé cats. Come meet Jill\, enjoy great conversation\, and support rescue cats while celebrating a local author and cherished member of our Catfé family. 💕🐾📚🍷  \nBio: Jill Rosenberg is a graduate of Vassar College and the MFA Program at the University of Montana. Her fiction has been published by the Kenyon Review\, swamp pink\, Black Warrior Review\, and other journals. Her collections of stories\, Not I’m Photogenic and Other Stories I Tell Myself (https://blacklawrencepress.com/authors/jill-rosenberg/)\, won the St. Lawrence Book Prize. She currently writes and teaches in Montclair\, New Jersey\, where she also works with rescued cats and practices practicing Buddhism. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/literary-happy-hour-with-cats/
LOCATION:Catfe Montclair\, 356 Bloomfield Ave suite 5\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Literature
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Now-Im-Photogenic-and-Other-Stories-I-Tell-Myself.png
END:VEVENT
