SUMMARY:Game Night: Dungeons and Dragons
DESCRIPTION:Adventurers! Join us for a fun and fantastical one shot D&D campaign. We embrace the quirky\, the chaotic\, and the downright silly. No experience necessary\, we welcome players of all skill levels. We’re all about having a good laugh and creating unforgettable memories together. Players aged 16 and up are welcome to play. This is a safe space for all\, including LGBTQIA+ and Neurodiverse folk. \nPlayers will be playing the one shot: Heist Heist Baby!: In the bustling city of Waterdeep\, a shadowy underworld criminal known as Valerius Nightshadeseeks the ultimate prize: the Heart of Ice\, a priceless blue diamond. To secure this coveted gem\, he assembles a team of skilled individuals\, each with their own unique talents and secrets. Together\, this team of rogues and misfits must overcome personal conflicts and trust issues to accomplish their daring mission. Will they succeed in their audacious heist\, or will the secrets that bind them lead to their undoing? \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/game-night-dungeons-and-dragons-2/
LOCATION:The Eclectic Chic Boutique\, 547 Bloomfield Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
