SUMMARY:Montclair Theater Festival
DESCRIPTION:Step into a day of theater magic\, live performances\, and community fun at the Montclair Theater Festival! Presented by Vanguard Theater\, this vibrant one-day event features family-friendly shows like Suessical: The Musical and Shakespeare’s The Tempest\, alongside performances from local artists\, food trucks\, and hands-on activities for all ages. Whether you’re a theater lover\, an artist\, or just looking for a fun day out with family\, there’s something for everyone to enjoy. Come celebrate the arts\, connect with your community\, and make unforgettable memories! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
